v>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Why Choose <span class=\"section-title-gold\">Atlas Aircon</span> for AC Fitting in Vadodara?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"mb-6\">When it comes to AC fitting, you need a service that&#8217;s not just fast, but flawless. At Atlas Aircon, we&#8217;ve built our reputation on precision, professionalism, and transparent pricing. We understand the Vadodara climate and the importance of a perfectly installed air conditioner. We don&#8217;t just fit ACs; we engineer your comfort for years to come.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"space-y-4 text-lg\">\r\n<li class=\"flex items-start\"><strong class=\"font-bold\">Certified &amp; Experienced Technicians:</strong> Our team consists of highly trained and background-verified professionals who are experts in fitting all brands and types of ACs.</li>\r\n<li class=\"flex items-start\"><strong class=\"font-bold\">Transparent AC Fitting Charges:</strong> No hidden costs. We provide a clear and upfront price list for all our services, including AC fitting, removal, and shifting.</li>\r\n<li class=\"flex items-start\"><strong class=\"font-bold\">24/7 Emergency Support:</strong> Need an urgent AC fitting or removal? Our team is available around the clock, serving all areas of Vadodara. We are the &#8217;24/7 ac fitting near me&#8217; you&#8217;ve been searching for.</li>\r\n<li class=\"flex items-start\"><strong class=\"font-bold\">Damage-Free Guarantee:</strong> We specialize in damage-free AC shifting and removal. We treat your property with the utmost care, ensuring a clean and professional job every time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-lg object-cover w-full h-full alignnone\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Installation-Process-of-Split-Air-conditioner-by-Atlas-Aircon-AC-Repair-Serivce-Vadodara-1.jpg\" alt=\"ac fitting in vadodara\" width=\"425\" height=\"280\" title=\"\"> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-lg object-cover w-full h-full\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Installation-Process-of-Split-Air-conditioner-by-Atlas-Aircon-AC-Repair-Vadodara.jpg\" alt=\"Detailed view of split AC installation\" title=\"\"> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-lg object-cover w-full h-full\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Window-AC-Installation-and-Repairing.webp\" alt=\"Window AC unit being fitted securely\" title=\"\"> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-lg object-cover w-full h-full\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Advantages-of-Professional-AC-Installation-Service-Provides-Atlas-Aircon-Vadodara.jpg\" alt=\"Happy customer with newly installed AC\" title=\"\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Price List Section -->\r\n<section id=\"pricing\" class=\"mb-16 scroll-mt-20\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-2\">Transparent AC Fitting Charges in Vadodara</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">We believe in honest work and honest pricing. Below is a detailed breakdown of our AC fitting cost in Vadodara. No surprises, just quality service.</p>\r\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto shadow-lg rounded-lg\">\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-left price-table\">\r\n<thead class=\"text-lg\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"p-4\">Service Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-4\">Description</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-4 text-right\">Estimated Charges (₹)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-200 bg-white\">\r\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-medium\">Split AC Fitting (Installation)</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">Standard fitting of a new indoor and outdoor unit with up to 3m of copper piping.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-bold text-lg\">₹1,499 &#8211; ₹2,499</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-medium\">Window AC Fitting (Installation)</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">Secure installation of a window AC unit, including sealing and support.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-bold text-lg\">₹749 &#8211; ₹1,199</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-medium\">AC Dismantle / Uninstallation</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">Professional removal of Split or Window AC, ensuring gas is safely pumped back.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-bold text-lg\">₹499 &#8211; ₹899</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-medium\">AC Shifting Service (within Vadodara)</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">Complete service of AC removing from one place to another place fitting. Includes dismantle, transport, and re-installation.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-bold text-lg\">₹2,499 &#8211; ₹3,999</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-medium\">AC Re-installation Service</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">Fitting an already uninstalled AC unit at a new location.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-bold text-lg\">₹1,299 &#8211; ₹2,199</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-medium\">Extra Copper Piping (per meter)</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">For installations requiring more than the standard length.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-bold text-lg\">₹750 &#8211; ₹950</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-center mt-4 text-sm text-gray-600\">*Prices are estimates and may vary based on AC type, complexity, and specific requirements. Final cost will be confirmed after inspection.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Service Process Section -->\r\n<section class=\"mb-16 bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-lg\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Our Simple 4-Step AC Fitting Process</h2>\r\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-primary-gold text-secondary-black rounded-full h-16 w-16 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">1</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Book Your Service</h3>\r\n<p>Call us or fill out our quote form. We&#8217;ll understand your needs and schedule a visit at your convenience.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-primary-gold text-secondary-black rounded-full h-16 w-16 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">2</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Site Inspection</h3>\r\n<p>Our technician arrives, assesses the location for optimal placement, and provides a final, transparent quote.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-primary-gold text-secondary-black rounded-full h-16 w-16 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">3</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Expert Fitting</h3>\r\n<p>We carry out the AC fitting, installation, or shifting with precision tools and attention to every detail.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-primary-gold text-secondary-black rounded-full h-16 w-16 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">4</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Cooling Test &amp; Cleanup</h3>\r\n<p>We test the AC for perfect cooling, ensure there are no leaks, and clean up the work area before we leave.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Detailed Services / Bullet Points -->\r\n<section class=\"mb-16\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Comprehensive AC Fitting and Shifting Services</h2>\r\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-primary-gold\">AC Fitting and Installation</h3>\r\n<p class=\"mb-4\">Whether you&#8217;ve bought a new Split AC or a Window AC, our expert AC fitters in Vadodara ensure a perfect installation. We focus on correct placement for maximum cooling efficiency, secure mounting, and proper electrical connections to give you peace of mind.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2\">\r\n<li><strong>Split AC Fitting Vadodara:</strong> Precise installation of both indoor and outdoor units.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Window AC Fitting Vadodara:</strong> Secure and weatherproof fitting for any window size.</li>\r\n<li>We also offer expert <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-accent-blue hover:underline\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-installation-in-vadodara.html\">AC installation in Vadodara</a> for commercial spaces.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-primary-gold\">AC Removal and Shifting</h3>\r\n<p class=\"mb-4\">Relocating your home or office? Our damage-free AC shifting service in Vadodara is the solution. We handle the entire process: professional AC dismantle, safe transportation, and expert re-installation at your new location. We are the most reliable AC shifting company in Vadodara.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2\">\r\n<li><strong>Professional AC Dismantling:</strong> Safely pump down refrigerant gas to prevent loss.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Damage-Free AC Removal:</strong> Careful handling of units to avoid any scratches or dents.</li>\r\n<li>Check our affordable <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-accent-blue hover:underline\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-service-charges-in-vadodara/\">AC service charges</a> for a complete package.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Brands and Areas Section -->\r\n<section class=\"mb-16 text-center\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">We Service All Major AC Brands</h2>\r\n<p class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-lg mb-6\">Our technicians are trained to handle AC fitting and removal for a wide range of brands. From Voltas and LG to Daikin and O General, we&#8217;ve got you covered.</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-gray-500\">Blue Star • Carrier • Croma • Cruise • Daikin • Haier • Hitachi • Kelvinator • Kenstar • LG • Lloyd • Mitsubishi • National • O General • Onida • Panasonic • Re-Connect • Sharp • Voltas</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- FAQ Section -->\r\n<section class=\"mb-16\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\r\n<div id=\"faq-container\" class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4\"><!-- FAQ Item 1 -->\r\n<div class=\"faq-item border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">What are the split AC fitting charges in Vadodara?</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer px-4 bg-white text-gray-700\">The standard split AC fitting charges in Vadodara typically range from ₹1,499 to ₹2,499. This cost includes installing the indoor and outdoor units and connecting them with up to 3 meters of copper piping. Additional charges may apply for extra piping or complex installations requiring special brackets or core drilling.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 2 -->\r\n<div class=\"faq-item border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">How much does Window AC fitting cost in Vadodara?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faq-arrow transform transition-transform\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer px-4 bg-white text-gray-700\">The cost for window AC fitting in Vadodara is quite affordable, generally between ₹749 and ₹1,199. This service includes placing the unit securely in the window frame, ensuring it is properly supported and sealed to prevent air leaks. The final price depends on the size of the unit and any necessary modifications.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 3 -->\r\n<div class=\"faq-item border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">What is included in an AC shifting service?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faq-arrow transform transition-transform\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer px-4 bg-white text-gray-700\">Our AC shifting service is a complete package for relocating your air conditioner. It includes the professional dismantling of the unit at your old address, safe transportation to the new location within Vadodara, and expert re-installation (fitting). This ensures your AC is moved without damage and functions perfectly after the shift.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 4 -->\r\n<div class=\"faq-item border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Do you provide damage-free AC removal and fitting?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faq-arrow transform transition-transform\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer px-4 bg-white text-gray-700\">Yes, absolutely. We pride ourselves on our damage-free AC removal and fitting process. Our technicians use proper tools and techniques to dismantle, transport, and install your AC unit, ensuring no harm comes to the appliance, your walls, or your property. Your satisfaction and the safety of your equipment are our top priorities.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 5 -->\r\n<div class=\"faq-item border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">How quickly can you provide AC fitting service near me?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faq-arrow transform transition-transform\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer px-4 bg-white text-gray-700\">We offer same-day and 24/7 emergency AC fitting services throughout Vadodara. In most cases, we can have a technician at your doorstep within 2-4 hours of your call. Our wide network across areas like Alkapuri, Manjalpur, and Waghodia Road ensures a prompt response time for all your urgent needs.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Add more FAQs as needed --></div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Service Area Section -->\r\n<section class=\"mb-16 bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-lg\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4\">Proudly Serving All of Vadodara</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">No matter where you are in Vadodara, our team can reach you. We offer our expert AC fitting and shifting services across all major localities and industrial areas.</p>\r\n<div class=\"text-sm text-center text-gray-600 leading-relaxed columns-2 sm:columns-3 md:columns-4 lg:columns-5\">Ajwa Road, Akota, Alkapuri, Asoj, Atladara, Bajwa, Baranpura, Bhayli, Bill, Chhani, Dabhoi Road, Dandia Bazar, Danteshwar, Dashrath, Diwalipura, Dumad, Ellora Park, Fatehganj, Gorwa, Gotri, Harni, Jetalpur Road, Kalali, Karelibaug, Makarpura, GIDC, Mandvi, Maneja, Manjalpur, Muj Mahuda, Nizampura, Old Padra Road, Padra, Race Course, Ranoli, Raopura, Sama, Sayajigunj, Sevasi, Subhanpura, Tandalja, Tarsali, Undera, Vadiwadi, Vadsar, Vasna Road, VIP Road, Waghodia Road, Warasiya &amp; more.</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Final CTA Section -->\r\n<section class=\"text-center bg-cover bg-center rounded-lg p-12\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.7), rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.7)), url('https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Window-ac-Repair-service.webp');\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Ready for a Perfectly Cooled Room?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-lg text-gray-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8\">Don&#8217;t settle for less. Get the best AC fitting service in Vadodara with transparent charges and a satisfaction guarantee. Contact Atlas Aircon now for a fast and professional installation.</p>\r\n<a class=\"btn-gold text-xl px-10 py-4 rounded-lg inline-block animate-pulse\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\"> Call +91-9727257141 to Book Now </a>\r\n<div class=\"mt-6 text-white\">\r\n<p class=\"font-semibold\">Or reach us via email:</p>\r\n<a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"mailto:hello@atlasaircons.com\">hello@atlasaircons.com</a> | <a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"mailto:atlasaircon1@gmail.com\">atlasaircon1@gmail.com</a></div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Internal Links Section -->\r\n<section class=\"py-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Explore Our Other Services</h2>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-4 text-center\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-repair-in-vadodara.html\">AC Repair in Vadodara</a> <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-gas-refilling/\">AC Gas Refilling</a> <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/ac-repair/window-air-conditioner-services.html\">Window AC Repair</a> <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-service-charges-in-vadodara/\">AC Service Charges</a></div>\r\n</section>\r\n</main><!-- Popup Container -->\r\n<div id=\"popup-overlay\" class=\"popup-overlay\">\r\n<div id=\"popup-content\" class=\"popup-content\"><span id=\"popup-close\" class=\"popup-close\">×</span>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-primary-gold\">Get a Free Quote!</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-center mb-6\">Get a quick &amp; free e